    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.poster.avif?t=1755609551\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.webm?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.mp4?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainrot Kart</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer kart racing game</strong> where players compete in fast-paced, chaotic races. Choose from a variety of outrageous maps like <strong>&quot;Gooning Gateway&quot;</strong> and use unique items such as a <strong>Hawk Tuah ball</strong> to attack and sabotage other players. Show off your wild karts to your bros, including <strong>Quandale Dingle</strong> and <strong>Skibidi Toilet</strong>, each offering different kart stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainrot Kart Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rizzy Brainrot Kart Action: Tear through chaotic maps and unleash wild items like the Hawk Tuah Ball</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-Player Multiplayer: Race and brainrot with your homies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goated Karts: Choose from cracked options like Quandale Dingle and Skibidi Toilet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doesn't cost $80 like other kart games</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your rizz by karting with the squad, or go solo to dominate every Brainrot track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, Rizz, Goon, Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.poster.avif?t=1755609551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.webm?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.mp4?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.poster.avif?t=1755609551\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.webm?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/e39cf20e2257e744a97913d6217db7f8.mp4?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainrot Kart</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer kart racing game</strong> where players compete in fast-paced, chaotic races. Choose from a variety of outrageous maps like <strong>&quot;Gooning Gateway&quot;</strong> and use unique items such as a <strong>Hawk Tuah ball</strong> to attack and sabotage other players. Show off your wild karts to your bros, including <strong>Quandale Dingle</strong> and <strong>Skibidi Toilet</strong>, each offering different kart stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainrot Kart Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rizzy Brainrot Kart Action: Tear through chaotic maps and unleash wild items like the Hawk Tuah Ball</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-Player Multiplayer: Race and brainrot with your homies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goated Karts: Choose from cracked options like Quandale Dingle and Skibidi Toilet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doesn't cost $80 like other kart games</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your rizz by karting with the squad, or go solo to dominate every Brainrot track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, Rizz, Goon, Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.poster.avif?t=1755609551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.webm?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411440/extras/cde337abaf46e5c765e43fc51c9a8a1c.mp4?t=1755609551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Brainrot Kart is a 1-8 player kart racing game. Race with the homies through chaotic maps like &quot;Gooning Gateway&quot; and &quot;The Backrooms,&quot; and launch Hawk Tuahs at your rivals to throw them off course. Expect nonstop brainrot that\u2019ll keep you on edge.",
